{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>כען, מלח היכלא</b> — from the domain of כעשן נמלחו, ארץ מלחה לא תשב; and the sense of the word is negation and prevention of a thing." "<b>וערות מלכא</b> — like את ערות הארץ, and the meaning is disgrace." "<b>ואריך</b> — Targum [renders] וייחל עוד, ואוריך עוד. And he explained the verse thus: the destruction of the temple we have brought about, and the disgrace of the king and his shame we shall not prolong to see."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {0 "The Aramaic phrase כען מלח היכלא is quoted from Ezra 4:14; the biblical Hebrew proofs cited are from Gen 19:26 (כעשן נמלחו, with suffixed form) and possibly Zeph 2:9.", 2 "The Targumic forms וייחל עוד and ואוריך עוד are quoted as renderings of ואריך; 'he' who explained the verse is unidentified in the text and may refer to a prior exegete."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:41:56.798711738Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}